#basePath Chapter10

::OnContractSelectOpenCh10
@trigger OnContractSelectOpen
@cutscene 
@once 

{@MAL}      Isn't g-g-g-great to hear your best-friend be promoted to CEO?
{@Player}   Did you know M.A.L.?
{@MAL}      Kn-n-n-ow what? 
{@Player}   That Dorian was heir to Frontier Robotics? 
{@MAL}      My-my records indica------
{@MAL}      I have n000 recoll3ction iN my Arch1ves. 
{@Player}   ...okay. 

::BeforeSupplyChainCh10

@trigger 	OnOverarhcing 
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Design)
@cutscene 
@once 

{@Quinn}    Hey... Cap'. 
{@Player}   What?
{@Quinn}    We just uh... wanted to check in with you. 
{@Joel}     Given the whole... new CEO sitch. 
{@Player}   I just, I can't believe he lied to me. 
{@Joel}     Certainly is bitter... and it ain't right. 
{@Quinn}    Whatever happens Cap' we got your back.     
{@Joel}     Yup! We can even be your new laser-tag buds. 
{@Quinn}    Oh STARS YAY! 
{@Player}   Thanks guys.
{@Player}   I'm grateful to have you on my team. 
{@Quinn}    Awe... that's gross. 
{@Joel}     Quinnie appreciates you too. 
{@Joel}     ...
{@Joel}     Wait, you didn't correct me Quinnie. 
{@Quinn}    ...I'm growing into the name... again. 

::AfterSupplyChainCh10
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply)
@cutscene 
@once

{@Taryn}    Heya, Locke. 
{@Player}   Taryn. Hey. 
{@Taryn}    Blaze, wanted me to check in on you. 
{@Player}   Oh, uh. I'm...
{@Player}   Getting through. 
{@Taryn}    Yea. 
{@Taryn}    I know you've got lots to do, but know that Kalvis welcomes you. 
{@Taryn}    I'm just a messenger but it would be cool to meet you in physical space. 
{@Player}   Once I wrap things up, I'll see if I can visit. 
{@Taryn}    Yay! I'll have to show you my garden if you do. 
{@Taryn}    Stay safe Locke. 